{"id":"grotte","lemma":"grotte","pos":"noun","rank":3137,"glosses":["cave (a large, naturally occurring cavity formed underground)"],"ipa":"/ɡʁɔt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/65/Fr-grotte.ogg/Fr-grotte.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"grottes"},"formAudio":{"grottes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/29/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-grottes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Que faisais-tu dans cette grotte ?","en":"What were you doing in that cave?","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]},{"text":"La grotte est facile d'accès.","en":"The cave is easy to get to.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"easy, simple"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"access"}]},{"text":"Ils rampèrent hors de la grotte.","en":"They crawled out of the cave.","words":[{"g":"they"},null,null,null,{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"out of, outside"]]},{"text":"Personne ne put trouver la grotte.","en":"No one could find the cave.","words":[{"g":"no one, nobody"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to find"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"On s'est perdus dans la grotte.","en":"We got lost in the cave.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"lost","l":"perdu"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}